      'Scoring example: Each player scores the value of cards in one suit (counted positive) minus cards of other suits (counted negative). Aces=11, 10/J/Q/K=10, 2-9=face value. Maximum possible score is 41 (A-K-Q-J of one suit). Player with the highest score wins the round. In case of a tie, the player whose worst card is highest wins..',
